      "text": [
        "1130 - وَقَالَ لَهُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ رَجُلٌ أُصَلِّي فِي أَهْلِي ثُمَّ أَخْرُجُ إِلَى اَلْمَسْجِدِ فَيُقَدِّمُونِي فَقَالَ «تَقَدَّمْ لاَ عَلَيْكَ وَ صَلِّ بِهِمْ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1130 - A man said to him (as):\n\"I pray with my family, then I go to the mosque and they ask me to lead them in prayer.\"\nImam (as) said: \"Go ahead and lead them; there is no harm in it. Pray with them.\""
        ]
      }
